{"seq":1,"slug":"liburing-rust-bindings-runtime-selection","title":"语言绑定生态：liburing、Rust io-uring/glommio/tokio-uring 的抽象层次与选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/io-uring-linux-high-performance-async-io-engineering/perf-tuning-language-bindings-production/liburing-rust-bindings-runtime-selection","wordCount":2671,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"语言绑定生态-liburing-rust-io-uring-glommio-tokio-uring-的抽象层次与选型\">语言绑定生态：liburing、Rust io-uring/glommio/tokio-uring 的抽象层次与选型</h1><p>写 io_uring 程序时，第一个绕不开的工程决定不是&quot;用哪个 opcode&quot;，而是&quot;站到哪一层抽象上&quot;。内核只认 SQE/CQE 这层共享内存协议，但直接手写 <code>mmap</code> + 原子 tail 维护的代码几乎没人愿意维护，于是社区长出了三层包装：C 的 liburing 提供语义化 helper，Rust 的 <code>io-uring</code> crate 提供类型化的低层封装，glommio/monoio/compio 们在上面再搭一个 thread-per-core 运行时。层与层之间不是&quot;谁替代谁&quot;，而是&quot;谁承担哪部分责任&quot;的切分——选错层，你要么被 unsafe 淹没，要么被运行时的调度假设拖慢。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把从应用到内核的路径拆开看，io_uring 的每一层包装都在做同一件事：<strong>把&quot;填 SQE—发布 tail—消费 CQE&quot;这套机械动作收敛成一个函数或一个 <code>Future</code></strong>。区别只在于收敛得有多彻底，以及为此牺牲了多少控制权。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;应用业务逻辑&lt;br/&gt;读文件 / 收包 / fsync&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;异步运行时&lt;br/&gt;glommio / monoio / compio / tokio-uring&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;低层类型化封装&lt;br/&gt;Rust io-uring crate&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; D[&quot;C 语义化 helper&lt;br/&gt;liburing 2.15&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; E[&quot;原始协议层&lt;br/&gt;mmap 共享环 + SQE/CQE&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;内核 io_uring 子系统&lt;br/&gt;5.1 起逐步成形&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"应用业务逻辑&lt;br/&gt;读文件 / 收包 / fsync\"] --&gt; B[\"异步运行时&lt;br/&gt;glommio / monoio / compio / tokio-uring\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"低层类型化封装&lt;br/&gt;Rust io-uring crate\"]\n  B --&gt; D[\"C 语义化 helper&lt;br/&gt;liburing 2.15\"]\n  C --&gt; E[\"原始协议层&lt;br/&gt;mmap 共享环 + SQE/CQE\"]\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[\"内核 io_uring 子系统&lt;br/&gt;5.1 起逐步成形\"]</pre><p>层数越多，抽象的&quot;距离&quot;越远。liburing 是<strong>薄封装</strong>：它不认识对象的生命周期，只帮你把 <code>io_uring_prep_read()</code> 这类 helper 展开成正确的 SQE 字段然后提交。Rust 的 <code>io-uring</code> crate 是<strong>低层类型化封装</strong>：用类型系统给 opcode 加上形状（<code>opcode::Read</code> 是结构体，字段有类型），但把&quot;缓冲区必须活到 CQE 返回&quot;这条不变式交给调用者用 <code>unsafe</code> 保证。运行时（glommio、monoio、compio、tokio-uring）是<strong>最厚的一层</strong>：接管内存所有权，把每个 IO 变成可 <code>.await</code> 的 <code>Future</code>，代价是替你决定了线程模型、缓冲区生命周期和 reactor 调度策略。</p>\n<p>一个粗略但实用的成本模型能解释为什么层厚不一定快。设单次 IO 端到端成本为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>op</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>syscall</mtext></msub><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>batch</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>reactor</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>user</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{op}} = \\frac{C_{\\text{syscall}}}{n_{\\text{batch}}} + C_{\\text{reactor}} + C_{\\text{user}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">op</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">batch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">syscall</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reactor</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">user</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>syscall</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{syscall}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">syscall</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 <code>io_uring_enter</code> 的固定开销，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>batch</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{\\text{batch}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">batch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是一次提交攒的请求数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>reactor</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{reactor}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reactor</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是运行时的任务唤醒/调度开销，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>user</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{user}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">user</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是业务处理时间。薄封装把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>reactor</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{reactor}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reactor</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 压到近零但要求你自己管 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>batch</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{\\text{batch}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">batch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；厚运行时的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>reactor</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{reactor}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reactor</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 随任务数与唤醒方式上升，却替你自动批量化。这就是&quot;低延迟单线程&quot;常选薄层、&quot;高并发连接&quot;常选运行时的原因。</p>\n<p>下表给出 2026 年这一生态的实测定位（版本与下载量取自 crates.io / GitHub API，检索于 2026-10-05）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>绑定</th>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>最新版本</th>\n<th>最后发布</th>\n<th>累计下载</th>\n<th>维护方</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>liburing</td>\n<td>C 薄封装</td>\n<td>2.15</td>\n<td>2026-06-29</td>\n<td>—（C 库，随发行版）</td>\n<td>Jens Axboe（内核原作者）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>io-uring</td>\n<td>Rust 低层</td>\n<td>0.7.15</td>\n<td>2026-09-07</td>\n<td>60,423,829</td>\n<td>tokio-rs 组织</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tokio-uring</td>\n<td>Rust 运行时</td>\n<td>0.5.0</td>\n<td>2024-05-27</td>\n<td>2,980,508</td>\n<td>tokio-rs 组织</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>glommio</td>\n<td>Rust 运行时</td>\n<td>0.9.0</td>\n<td>2024-03-25</td>\n<td>168,263</td>\n<td>DataDog</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>monoio</td>\n<td>Rust 运行时</td>\n<td>0.2.4</td>\n<td>2024-08-20</td>\n<td>1,607,129</td>\n<td>ByteDance</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>compio</td>\n<td>Rust 运行时</td>\n<td>0.19.2（stable）</td>\n<td>2026-09-29</td>\n<td>966,879</td>\n<td>compio-rs 社区</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>版本号本身就是信号：<code>io-uring</code> 用 0.x 表示&quot;接口未冻结&quot;，liburing 已走到 2.15 这种成熟序列，而几个运行时的发布节奏差异巨大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"c-层-liburing-的薄封装与版本配套\">C 层：liburing 的薄封装与版本配套</h2><p>liburing 是 Jens Axboe（io_uring 内核子系统作者）亲自维护的用户态库，它的设计哲学是&quot;零抽象税&quot;：所有 <code>io_uring_prep_*</code> 函数都是 <code>static inline</code>，展开后就是往 SQE 里写字段，编译后与手写等价。它的价值不在性能，而在<strong>把协议细节和内核版本差异钉在一处</strong>。</p>\n<p>最要紧的工程约束是<strong>版本三配套</strong>：用户态 liburing、头文件 <code>linux/io_uring.h</code>、内核版本必须相互兼容。liburing 2.15（2026-06-29 发布，见 <a href=\"https://api.github.com/repos/axboe/liburing/releases/latest\">axboe/liburing releases</a>）在运行时能探测内核能力，但编译期用到的结构体布局必须与目标头文件一致——交叉编译或容器化时不带 <code>-I</code> 指向正确内核头，就会出现&quot;编译通过、运行时 <code>EINVAL</code>&quot;的经典故障。它的 helper（<code>io_uring_prep_read/write</code>、<code>io_uring_prep_recv_multishot</code>、<code>io_uring_prep_provide_buffers</code>、<code>io_uring_submit_and_wait</code>）覆盖了上一节的协议操作；<strong>若你正在用 <code>io_uring_enter(2)</code> 裸系统调用，大概率在重复实现它已写对的边界检查</strong>。另一个常被忽略的细节是 setup flag：<code>SQPOLL</code> 让内核起轮询线程替你提交，开启后连 <code>io_uring_enter</code> 都省了，代价是一个常驻内核线程烧 CPU——典型的&quot;用核换延迟&quot;，只在超低延迟场景成立。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rust-低层-io-uring-crate-的-unsafe-契约\">Rust 低层：io-uring crate 的 unsafe 契约</h2><p><code>io-uring</code> crate（仓库 <a href=\"https://github.com/tokio-rs/io-uring\">tokio-rs/io-uring</a>，2026-09-07 发布 0.7.15，累计下载 6000 万+）是 Rust 生态的事实标准低层封装，设计目标明确：<strong>用类型系统描述 SQE，但不碰任何生命周期管理</strong>。</p>\n<p>它把每个 opcode 建模成一个实现了 <code>OpCode</code> trait 的结构体，例如 <code>opcode::Read</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"let mut ring = IoUring::new(8)?;&#10;let fd = File::open(&quot;data.bin&quot;)?;&#10;let mut buf = vec![0u8; 4096];&#10;let read_e = opcode::Read::new(types::Fd(file.as_raw_fd()), buf.as_mut_ptr(), buf.len() as _)&#10;    .offset(0).build().user_data(0x42);&#10;&#10;unsafe { ring.submission().push(&amp;read_e).expect(&quot;queue full&quot;) };&#10;ring.submit_and_wait(1)?;&#10;let cqe = ring.completion().next().expect(&quot;no completion&quot;);&#10;assert_eq!(cqe.user_data(), 0x42);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let mut ring = IoUring::new(8)?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let fd = File::open(\"data.bin\")?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let mut buf = vec![0u8; 4096];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let read_e = opcode::Read::new(types::Fd(file.as_raw_fd()), buf.as_mut_ptr(), buf.len() as _)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .offset(0).build().user_data(0x42);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>unsafe { ring.submission().push(&#x26;read_e).expect(\"queue full\") };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ring.submit_and_wait(1)?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let cqe = ring.completion().next().expect(\"no completion\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>assert_eq!(cqe.user_data(), 0x42);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意那个 <code>unsafe</code> 块：<strong>它是整个 crate 安全模型的核心</strong>。crate 的 README 明确写道，压入 SQ 的条目的资源（fd、buffer）必须在&quot;内核可能使用它的整个期间&quot;保持有效。类型系统能保证你填的字段有正确类型，却无法保证 <code>buf</code> 不会在你拿到 CQE 之前被 <code>drop</code>。这条不变式借用检查器无法静态验证，必须由调用者承担——这正是&quot;低层封装&quot;与&quot;运行时&quot;的分界线。</p>\n<p><code>user_data</code> 在这层完全由你支配，意味着上一节的 multishot 陷阱（<code>IORING_CQE_F_MORE</code> 未检查就释放上下文）在这层完全没有护栏。运行时会把这层契约包进 <code>Future</code> 的 <code>drop</code> 语义：<code>Future</code> 未完成就被 drop 时，运行时会取消对应请求并等待其 CQE，避免悬垂缓冲区。薄层换来的控制力，代价就是这套纪律得自己背。</p>\n<p>实践建议：如果 <code>unsafe</code> 密度已高到需要写&quot;每个 CQE 对应哪块内存&quot;的注释表格，就该往上一层；反之，若在做存储引擎的 io_uring 后端、需要把固定缓冲区反复注册（<code>IORING_REGISTER_BUFFERS</code>）并精确控制 <code>READ_FIXED</code> 偏移，薄层就是唯一正确选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rust-运行时-thread-per-core-与-work-stealing-的分野\">Rust 运行时：thread-per-core 与 work-stealing 的分野</h2><p>Rust 的 io_uring 运行时分成两大流派，分野在于<strong>任务如何被分配到执行线程</strong>。</p>\n<p>第一派是 <strong>thread-per-core</strong>：每个核心跑一个单线程 executor，任务不跨核迁移，IO 提交与完成都留在同一核上。glommio（DataDog）和 monoio（ByteDance）属于这一派，设计前提是&quot;缓存局部性比负载均衡更重要&quot;——跨核搬运任务会打掉 L1/L2 缓存，而 io_uring 的共享环本身就能在一个核上达到极高吞吐。代价是负载不均时会有核空转，需应用自己做分片。</p>\n<p>第二派是 <strong>work-stealing</strong>：任务可在核间迁移以平衡负载，tokio-uring 走这条路——它给 Tokio 加一个独立的 io_uring 运行时（<code>tokio_uring::start</code>），任务仍是 Tokio 任务，只在做 IO 时走 io_uring。好处是能复用 Tokio 生态的库，坏处是任务迁移的调度开销，以及 io_uring 与 Tokio reactor 的边界复杂度。</p>\n<p>第三派是 <strong>completion-based 的无色异步</strong>：compio（0.19.2 stable，2026-09-29）用 completion-based 的 <code>Future</code> 设计，试图兼顾 thread-per-core 性能与接近 tokio 的 API 体验，是生态里迭代最活跃的项目之一。</p>\n<p>三派的定位差异可以用选型判据表收束：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>thread-per-core（glommio/monoio）</th>\n<th>work-stealing（tokio-uring）</th>\n<th>completion-based（compio）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>延迟确定性</td>\n<td>高（无迁移）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负载均衡</td>\n<td>需应用分片</td>\n<td>运行时自动</td>\n<td>需应用分片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生态兼容</td>\n<td>独立生态</td>\n<td>复用 Tokio 库</td>\n<td>独立生态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>项目成熟度</td>\n<td>monoio 下载量最高</td>\n<td>Tokio 背书</td>\n<td>迭代最活跃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内核要求</td>\n<td>5.8+（glommio）</td>\n<td>5.11+</td>\n<td>跟随低层 crate</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>内核版本是硬门槛</strong>：glommio 的 README 声明最低支持内核 5.8、最低 Rust 1.70；tokio-uring 则明确说&quot;内核 5.4.0 不行、Ubuntu HWE 的 5.11.0 可以&quot;——因为它依赖的功能集更宽。部署到老内核（CentOS 7 的 3.10、Ubuntu 20.04 的 5.4）前，必须先验证目标功能在哪个内核落地，再决定运行时；这比任何 benchmark 都先决。</p>\n<p>维护活跃度也是选型变量，且不能只看 release 日期：tokio-uring 自 2024-05-27 的 0.5.0 后再无发布，README 仍写着&quot;项目还很年轻&quot;；glommio 的 0.9.0 停在 2024-03-25，但仓库最后提交是 2026-08-31，且未见归档（<code>archived: false</code>，见 <a href=\"https://api.github.com/repos/DataDog/glommio\">DataDog/glommio</a>）。要区分&quot;发版停滞但仍在维护&quot;与&quot;真正停止开发&quot;——前者可依赖主线 commit，后者只能 fork 或换栈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生产选型的四条判据\">生产选型的四条判据</h2><p>按四条判据依次过滤，任何一条不满足都先解决再谈性能：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>内核与发行版先行</strong>。目标机器内核 &lt; 5.8 直接放弃运行时路线；5.8–5.10 只能选 glommio 这类低门槛运行时或退回 liburing；5.11+ 才打开 tokio-uring 的门。这是硬性依赖而非性能偏好。</li>\n<li><strong>按延迟敏感度选派别</strong>。竞价、高频交易这类要求 P99.9 延迟确定的场景选 thread-per-core（monoio/glommio），宁可自己写信片也不要 work-stealing 的迁移抖动；吞吐优先、负载波动大的场景选 tokio-uring 换取自动均衡。</li>\n<li><strong>按控制粒度选层次</strong>。需要固定缓冲区注册、精确 opcode 控制、SQPOLL 调优的存储/网络栈，下沉到 <code>io-uring</code> crate 或 liburing；纯业务开发上运行时。判据是&quot;你是否需要知道 SQE 长什么样&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>把维护风险当一等成本</strong>。发版停滞的运行时要么锁版本自测、要么准备 fork。<code>io-uring</code> 的 0.7.x 在 2025–2026 保持约每月一版（0.7.11 到 0.7.15 跨 2025-11 至 2026-09），是整栈里最稳的地基。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>绑定生态分三层：liburing（C 薄封装）、io-uring crate（Rust 低层类型化）、运行时（glommio/monoio/compio/tokio-uring 厚封装）。层不是替代关系，是责任切分。</li>\n<li>liburing 2.15（2026-06-29）是内核作者维护的零税封装，核心约束是用户态库、头文件、内核版本三配套，交叉编译尤需注意。</li>\n<li><code>io-uring</code> crate（0.7.15，2026-09-07，6000 万+ 下载）是事实标准低层封装，安全模型依赖调用者用 <code>unsafe</code> 保证缓冲区生命周期——multishot 场景下没有护栏。</li>\n<li>Rust 运行时分 thread-per-core（glommio/monoio）与 work-stealing（tokio-uring）两派，completion-based 的 compio 是第三条路；选择由延迟确定性、负载均衡与生态兼容性决定。</li>\n<li>内核 5.8 与 5.11 是两条硬门槛线；发版停滞不等于停止维护（glommio 0.9.0 停在 2024 但仓库仍在更新），维护风险要量化为锁版本或 fork 的成本。</li>\n<li>落地按&quot;内核先行 → 延迟选派 → 控制粒度选层 → 维护风险兜底&quot;四条判据依次过滤。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>上一节 <a href=\"../uring-ring-sqe-cqe-mechanics/shared-ring-mmap-sq-cq-layout-entries\">共享环的内存布局</a> 解释了 SQE/CQE 在内存里的排布，是所有绑定的共同地基；这一节讨论的每一层包装最终都要落到那块 <code>mmap</code> 出来的环形缓冲区上。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"语言绑定生态：liburing、Rust io-uring/glommio/tokio-uring 的抽象层次与选型","id":"语言绑定生态-liburing-rust-io-uring-glommio-tokio-uring-的抽象层次与选型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"C 层：liburing 的薄封装与版本配套","id":"c-层-liburing-的薄封装与版本配套"},{"level":2,"text":"Rust 低层：io-uring crate 的 unsafe 契约","id":"rust-低层-io-uring-crate-的-unsafe-契约"},{"level":2,"text":"Rust 运行时：thread-per-core 与 work-stealing 的分野","id":"rust-运行时-thread-per-core-与-work-stealing-的分野"},{"level":2,"text":"生产选型的四条判据","id":"生产选型的四条判据"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"零拷贝与固定缓冲：sendmsg ZC、registered buffers/files 的注册生命周期与异常","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/io-uring-linux-high-performance-async-io-engineering/network-disk-workloads-zerocopy/zerocopy-sendmsg-fixed-buffers-registered-iovec"},"next":{"title":"生产调优：内核版本特性矩阵、SQE 批处理、CQE 溢出与内存锁定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/io-uring-linux-high-performance-async-io-engineering/perf-tuning-language-bindings-production/production-tuning-kernel-version-sqe-batching-cqe-overflow"}}